        'The Faculty of Medicine aims to prepare highly qualified doctors with the scientific knowledge, clinical skills, professional ethics, and practical experience required to provide quality healthcare. Students receive comprehensive education in basic medical sciences, including anatomy, physiology, biochemistry, histology, microbiology, immunology, pathology, pharmacology, and parasitology. As students progress, they study clinical disciplines such as internal medicine, surgery, pediatrics, obstetrics and gynecology, ophthalmology, ENT, orthopedics, and other medical specialties. The faculty emphasizes clinical reasoning, disease diagnosis, treatment planning, patient communication, medical research, and evidence-based medicine. Its goal is to graduate competent physicians capable of contributing to healthcare services, medical research, and community health.': 'Tsangayar Likitanci na da burin shirya ƙwararrun likitoci masu ilimin kimiyya, ƙwarewar asibiti, ɗabi\'un sana\'a da gogewar aiki da ake buƙata don ba da kyakkyawar kulawar lafiya. Ɗalibai suna samun cikakken ilimi a fannonin kimiyyar likitanci na tushe, kamar ilimin jiki, ilimin aikin jiki, kimiyyar halittu, ilimin kyallen jiki, ilimin ƙananan halittu, ilimin garkuwar jiki, ilimin cututtuka, ilimin magunguna da ilimin ƙwayoyin cuta. Yayin da suke ci gaba, suna karanta fannonin asibiti kamar likitancin ciki, tiyata, likitancin yara, haihuwa da lafiyar mata, likitancin ido, kunne-hanci-maƙogwaro, likitancin ƙashi da sauransu. Tsangayar tana mai da hankali kan tunanin asibiti, gano cututtuka, tsara magani, sadarwa da marasa lafiya, binciken likitanci da likitanci bisa hujja. Burinta shi ne fitar da ƙwararrun likitoci masu iya ba da gudummawa ga ayyukan lafiya, binciken likitanci da lafiyar al\'umma.',
        'The Faculty of Oral and Dental Medicine prepares students to become competent dental professionals capable of diagnosing, preventing, and treating diseases affecting the teeth, gums, mouth, and surrounding structures. The academic programme combines foundational medical sciences with specialized dental education, including dental anatomy, oral biology, dental materials, oral pathology, periodontology, endodontics, prosthodontics, orthodontics, oral surgery, and pediatric dentistry. Students develop practical skills through laboratory exercises, simulation training, and supervised clinical practice. The faculty emphasizes preventive dentistry, patient management, oral health education, clinical decision-making, and modern dental technologies. Its mission is to graduate qualified dentists who can provide comprehensive oral healthcare and contribute to dental research and public health.': 'Tsangayar Likitancin Baki da Haƙori tana shirya likitocin haƙori don gano, kariya da magance cututtukan baki da haƙora. Ɗalibai suna karanta kimiyyar likitanci ta tushe tare da darussan haƙori na musamman kamar ilimin jikin haƙori, ilimin halittar baki, kayan aikin haƙori, cututtukan baki, ilimin dasashi, maganin jijiyar haƙori, haƙoran roba, daidaita haƙora, tiyatar baki da likitancin haƙorin yara. Shirin yana haɗa koyarwa a aji, horo a ɗakin gwaji da koyon asibiti, don ɗalibai su iya duba marasa lafiya, gano matsalolin haƙori da yin magani. Tsangayar tana jaddada kula da marasa lafiya cikin aminci, kariya daga cututtuka, ɗabi\'a da wayar da kai kan lafiyar baki. Waɗanda suka kammala suna shirye don ba da cikakkiyar kulawar lafiyar baki da ba da gudummawa ga binciken haƙori da lafiyar jama\'a.',
        'The Faculty of Pharmacy focuses on pharmaceutical sciences, medication development, drug safety, and the appropriate use of medicines in healthcare. Students study a broad range of subjects, including pharmaceutical chemistry, pharmacology, pharmacognosy, pharmaceutics, microbiology, biochemistry, clinical pharmacy, and medicinal chemistry. The programme provides knowledge about how drugs are discovered, formulated, manufactured, distributed, and used to prevent and treat diseases. Students also develop skills in medication counselling, pharmaceutical care, drug interactions, dosage calculations, and patient safety. Through laboratory training and practical learning, graduates are prepared for professional opportunities in community pharmacies, hospitals, pharmaceutical industries, drug manufacturing, research laboratories, regulatory organizations, and clinical pharmacy services.': 'Tsangayar Harhaɗa Magunguna tana mai da hankali kan kimiyyar magunguna, ƙirƙirar magani, amincin magani da amfani da magunguna yadda ya kamata. Ɗalibai suna karanta darussa da yawa kamar kimiyyar magunguna, ilimin magunguna, ilimin magungunan tsirrai, haɗa magunguna, ilimin ƙananan halittu, kimiyyar halittu, harhaɗa magunguna na asibiti da kimiyyar haɗa magani. Shirin yana bayyana yadda ake gano magunguna, haɗa su, ƙera su, rarraba su da amfani da su don kariya da maganin cututtuka. Ɗalibai kuma suna koyon ba da shawara kan magani, kulawar harhaɗa magunguna, mu\'amalar magunguna, lissafin adadin magani da amincin marasa lafiya. Ta horo a ɗakin gwaji, waɗanda suka kammala suna shirye don aiki a kantunan magani, asibitoci, masana\'antun magunguna, ɗakunan bincike, hukumomin sa ido da ayyukan harhaɗa magunguna na asibiti.',
        'The Faculty of Physical Therapy prepares students to help individuals recover, maintain, and improve their physical movement, mobility, strength, and overall functional abilities. The programme covers medical and rehabilitation sciences, including anatomy, physiology, kinesiology, biomechanics, therapeutic exercises, electrotherapy, manual therapy, and rehabilitation techniques. Students learn how to assess patients, identify movement limitations, develop rehabilitation programmes, and monitor recovery. Specialized areas include musculoskeletal rehabilitation, neurological rehabilitation, pediatric physical therapy, cardiopulmonary rehabilitation, and sports injuries. Practical training helps students develop the clinical skills needed to work with patients recovering from injuries, surgeries, neurological disorders, and physical disabilities. The faculty aims to produce skilled rehabilitation professionals who improve patients\' independence and quality of life.': 'Tsangayar Gyaran Jiki tana shirya ɗalibai don taimaka wa mutane su dawo, su kiyaye kuma su inganta motsin jiki, ƙarfi da iya yin ayyuka. Shirin ya ƙunshi kimiyyar likitanci da ta gyaran jiki, kamar ilimin jiki, ilimin aikin jiki, ilimin motsin jiki, injiniyar motsin jiki, motsa jiki don magani, maganin wutar lantarki, maganin hannu da dabarun gyaran jiki. Ɗalibai suna koyon duba marasa lafiya, gano matsalolin motsi, tsara shirye-shiryen gyara da bibiyar warkewa. Fannonin musamman sun haɗa da gyaran tsoka da ƙashi, gyaran jijiyoyi, gyaran jikin yara, gyaran zuciya da huhu da raunukan wasanni. Horon aiki yana taimaka wa ɗalibai su sami ƙwarewar aiki da marasa lafiya da ke warkewa daga rauni, tiyata, matsalolin jijiyoyi da nakasa. Tsangayar tana fitar da ƙwararru masu inganta dogaro da kai da rayuwar marasa lafiya.',
        'The Faculty of Nursing aims to prepare professional nurses with the knowledge, practical abilities, communication skills, and ethical values necessary to deliver safe and effective healthcare. Students study fundamental nursing concepts alongside medical sciences such as anatomy, physiology, microbiology, pharmacology, nutrition, and pathology. Specialized nursing subjects include medical-surgical nursing, pediatric nursing, maternal and newborn nursing, psychiatric and mental health nursing, community health nursing, critical care nursing, and nursing management. The academic programme combines classroom instruction, laboratory simulations, and clinical placements in healthcare settings. Students learn patient assessment, medication administration, wound care, infection prevention, emergency response, health education, and collaboration with other healthcare professionals. Graduates can pursue careers in hospitals, clinics, community health centres, and other healthcare institutions.': 'Tsangayar Aikin Jinya tana shirya ƙwararrun ma\'aikatan jinya masu ilimi, ƙwarewar aiki, iya sadarwa da ɗabi\'u don ba da kulawar lafiya mai aminci da inganci. Ɗalibai suna karanta tushen aikin jinya tare da kimiyyar likitanci kamar ilimin jiki, ilimin aikin jiki, ilimin ƙananan halittu, ilimin magunguna, abinci mai gina jiki da ilimin cututtuka. Darussan musamman sun haɗa da jinyar likitanci da tiyata, jinyar yara, jinyar uwa da jariri, jinyar lafiyar ƙwaƙwalwa, jinyar lafiyar al\'umma, jinyar kulawa ta gaggawa da gudanar da aikin jinya. Shirin yana haɗa koyarwa a aji, kwaikwayo a ɗakin gwaji da horo a asibitoci. Ɗalibai suna koyon duba marasa lafiya, ba da magani, kula da raunuka, kariya daga cututtuka, ayyukan gaggawa, wayar da kai kan lafiya da aiki tare da sauran ma\'aikatan lafiya. Waɗanda suka kammala za su iya aiki a asibitoci, cibiyoyin lafiyar al\'umma da sauran cibiyoyin kiwon lafiya.',
        'The Faculty of Engineering provides students with the scientific, mathematical, technical, and practical foundations required to solve complex engineering problems and develop innovative technologies. The programme emphasizes engineering mathematics, physics, computer applications, technical design, materials science, and engineering principles. Depending on the available academic departments and specializations, students may study areas such as civil engineering, electrical engineering, mechanical engineering, communications, electronics, and other engineering disciplines. Practical education involves laboratory experiments, engineering projects, computer-aided design, technical analysis, and teamwork. Students develop problem-solving, critical-thinking, project-management, and design skills. The faculty prepares graduates for professional opportunities in construction, manufacturing, infrastructure, energy, telecommunications, industrial development, research, and technology-related industries.': 'Tsangayar Injiniya tana ba ɗalibai tushen kimiyya, lissafi, fasaha da aiki don warware matsaloli masu sarƙaƙiya da haɓaka sabbin fasahohi. Shirin yana mai da hankali kan lissafin injiniya, kimiyyar lissafi, manhajojin kwamfuta, zane na fasaha, kimiyyar kayayyaki da ƙa\'idojin injiniya. Dangane da sassan da ake da su, ɗalibai za su iya karanta injiniyar gine-gine, wutar lantarki, injina, sadarwa, na\'urorin lantarki da sauransu. Ilimin aiki ya haɗa da gwaje-gwaje, ayyukan injiniya, zane da kwamfuta, nazari na fasaha da aiki tare. Ɗalibai suna samun ƙwarewar warware matsaloli, tunani mai zurfi, gudanar da ayyuka da zane. Tsangayar tana shirya su don ayyuka a gine-gine, masana\'antu, ababen more rayuwa, makamashi, sadarwa, bunƙasa masana\'antu, bincike da masana\'antun fasaha.',
        'The Faculty of Computer Science focuses on developing students\' understanding of computing systems, software technologies, digital innovation, and modern information systems. Students learn programming, algorithms, data structures, computer architecture, operating systems, databases, software engineering, computer networks, and web development. The programme may also cover advanced technological fields such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, cybersecurity, data science, cloud computing, mobile application development, and computer graphics. Through practical assignments, programming projects, laboratory work, and collaborative activities, students develop the ability to design, develop, test, and maintain software and computer-based systems. The faculty prepares graduates for careers as software developers, programmers, data analysts, cybersecurity specialists, systems engineers, AI developers, and IT professionals.': 'Tsangayar Kimiyyar Kwamfuta tana haɓaka fahimtar ɗalibai kan tsarin kwamfuta, fasahohin manhaja, sabbin abubuwan zamani da tsarin bayanai. Ɗalibai suna koyon shirye-shiryen kwamfuta, algoridam, tsarin bayanai, tsarin kwamfuta, tsarin sarrafa kwamfuta, rumbun bayanai, injiniyar manhaja, hanyoyin sadarwar kwamfuta da gina shafukan yanar gizo. Shirin kuma zai iya haɗawa da fasahar AI, koyon na\'ura, tsaron yanar gizo, kimiyyar bayanai, girgije, manhajojin waya da zanen kwamfuta. Ta ayyuka, shirye-shirye da aiki tare, ɗalibai suna koyon tsarawa, haɓakawa, gwadawa da kula da manhajoji da tsarin kwamfuta. Tsangayar tana shirya su don zama masu haɓaka manhaja, masu tsara shirin kwamfuta, masu nazarin bayanai, ƙwararrun tsaron yanar gizo, injiniyoyin tsari, masu haɓaka AI da ƙwararrun IT.',
        'The Faculty of Business Administration aims to develop students\' knowledge and professional abilities in business, management, finance, accounting, marketing, and entrepreneurship. Students study the principles of organizational management, business economics, financial accounting, managerial accounting, human resource management, business communication, marketing strategies, and business law. The academic programme also develops skills in leadership, strategic planning, financial analysis, problem-solving, negotiation, and decision-making. Students learn how organizations operate, how businesses manage their resources, how financial decisions are made, and how companies compete in local and international markets. The faculty prepares graduates for professional careers in banking, accounting, marketing, business management, human resources, financial services, entrepreneurship, and corporate administration.': 'Tsangayar Gudanar da Kasuwanci tana haɓaka ilimi da ƙwarewar ɗalibai a kasuwanci, gudanarwa, kuɗi, lissafin kuɗi, talla da kasuwanci na kai. Ɗalibai suna karanta gudanar da ƙungiyoyi, tattalin arzikin kasuwanci, lissafin kuɗi, lissafin gudanarwa, gudanar da ma\'aikata, sadarwar kasuwanci, dabarun talla da dokar kasuwanci. Shirin kuma yana haɓaka jagoranci, tsare-tsare, nazarin kuɗi, warware matsaloli, ciniki da yanke shawara. Ɗalibai suna koyon yadda ƙungiyoyi ke aiki, yadda kamfanoni ke sarrafa albarkatunsu, yadda ake yanke shawarar kuɗi da yadda kamfanoni ke gasa a kasuwannin gida da na waje. Tsangayar tana shirya su don ayyuka a banki, lissafin kuɗi, talla, gudanar da kasuwanci, ma\'aikata, ayyukan kuɗi, kasuwanci na kai da gudanar da kamfani.',
        'The Faculty of Mass Communication and Applied Languages focuses on developing students\' abilities in communication, journalism, media production, public relations, advertising, and language application. Students explore the principles of mass communication, media writing, digital journalism, broadcasting, television and radio production, public relations, advertising, and digital media. The applied languages component develops language proficiency and professional communication skills for academic, business, media, and international environments. Students gain practical experience in content creation, media presentation, research, translation, communication strategies, and digital storytelling. The faculty prepares graduates for careers in journalism, television, radio, digital media, public relations, advertising, corporate communication, translation, and other language-related professions.': 'Tsangayar Sadarwa da Harsunan Amfani tana haɓaka iyawar ɗalibai a sadarwa, aikin jarida, shirya shirye-shirye, hulɗa da jama\'a, talla da amfani da harsuna. Ɗalibai suna nazarin tushen sadarwa ga jama\'a, rubutun kafofin yaɗa labarai, aikin jarida na zamani, watsa shirye-shirye, shirya talabijin da rediyo, hulɗa da jama\'a, talla da kafofin zamani. Ɓangaren harsunan amfani yana ƙarfafa ƙwarewar harshe da sadarwar sana\'a a fannin ilimi, kasuwanci, kafofin yaɗa labarai da na ƙasashen waje. Ɗalibai suna samun gogewa a ƙirƙirar abun ciki, gabatarwa, bincike, fassara, dabarun sadarwa da ba da labari ta zamani. Tsangayar tana shirya su don ayyuka a aikin jarida, talabijin, rediyo, kafofin zamani, hulɗa da jama\'a, talla, sadarwar kamfani, fassara da sauran sana\'o\'in harshe.',
        'The Faculty of Fine Arts encourages creativity, artistic development, visual communication, and innovative thinking through specialized artistic education and practical experience. Students explore different forms of visual expression, including drawing, painting, sculpture, design, and other artistic disciplines, depending on the available departments and programmes. The academic experience combines artistic theory, creative experimentation, practical studio work, art history, visual composition, and the development of individual artistic techniques. Students learn how to communicate ideas through visual forms, develop original artistic concepts, and use traditional and modern creative tools. The faculty prepares graduates for careers in artistic production, creative industries, visual design, illustration, cultural institutions, exhibitions, and other professions involving artistic expression and design.': 'Tsangayar Fasahar Zane tana ƙarfafa ƙirƙira, haɓaka fasaha, sadarwa ta hoto da tunani mai zurfi ta hanyar ilimin fasaha na musamman da gogewar aiki. Ɗalibai suna gwada hanyoyi daban-daban na bayyanawa ta hoto, kamar zane, fenti, sassaka, zane-zane da sauran fannonin fasaha dangane da sassan da ake da su. Karatun ya haɗa ka\'idar fasaha, gwaji na ƙirƙira, aiki a ɗakin fasaha, tarihin fasaha, tsarin hoto da haɓaka salon kowane ɗalibi. Ɗalibai suna koyon isar da ra\'ayoyi ta hoto, ƙirƙirar sabbin ra\'ayoyin fasaha da amfani da kayan aikin ƙirƙira na gargajiya da na zamani. Tsangayar tana shirya su don ayyuka a samar da fasaha, masana\'antun ƙirƙira, zanen gani, zanen bayani, cibiyoyin al\'adu, nune-nune da sauran sana\'o\'in fasaha da zane.',
      },
